  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là đường trung bình của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. \n\t\t\tDo đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Xét <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> (chiều cao của tam giác đều cạnh </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/></mrow><mi>a</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">)</mtext></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>I</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> (</mtext></mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>K</mi><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> là đường trung bình của </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/></mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">). </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></semantics></math><br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>K</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>K</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>K</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>K</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>K</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>≈</mo><msup><mn>73</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mn>13</mn><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/a84de6797f8f5b8b9ca922d0ba609186dcba2c3deb82d919155f7c2ceb5fbcbc.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
